{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1743","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. Antifibonacci Cut"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"12 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that the memory limit is unusual."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's define the sequence of Fibonacci strings as follows: $$$f_0$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", $$$f_1$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", $$$f_i$$$ is $$$f_{i-1} + f_{i-2}$$$ for $$$i \\gt 1$$$ ($$$+$$$ denotes the concatenation of two strings). So, for example, $$$f_2$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", $$$f_3$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"101"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", $$$f_4$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10110"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For a given string $$$s$$$, let's define $$$g(s)$$$ as the number of ways to cut it into several (any number, possibly even just one) strings such that none of these strings are Fibonacci strings. For example, if $$$s$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10110101"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", $$$g(s) = 3$$$ since there are three ways to cut it:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"101101"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$+$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1011"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$+$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0101"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1011"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$+$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$+$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a sequence of strings $$$s_1, s_2, \\dots, s_n$$$. Calculate $$$g(s_1), g(s_1 + s_2), \\dots, g(s_1 + s_2 + \\ldots + s_n)$$$. Since these values can be huge, print them modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 3 \\cdot 10^3$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then, $$$n$$$ lines follow. The $$$i$$$-th line contains the string $$$s_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le |s_i| \\le 10^3$$$), consisting of characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and/or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print $$$n$$$ integers, where the $$$i$$$-th integer is $$$g(s_1 + s_2 + \\ldots + s_i) \\bmod 998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n10110101\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n1111\n1\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n3\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n10110101\n100100001110\n0000001100010001\n1111\n1001010100101010101001\n000100000010101111\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n561\n1466229\n9887505\n972227653\n52128355\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"G","problemCode":"1743G","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1743/problem/G"}